commits.message:
release: v4.2.0 — Coordination Hub + Smart Views + Permissions Editor + AI/Glass redesign wave

Major feature wave: Coordination Hub aggregating clash/rule-pack/federation/BCF/smart-view KPIs with health banner;
Smart Views v1 (rules-not-snapshots + share-by-link via itsdangerous + presets); Clash signature + Smart Issues +
AI triage + cost impact rollup; BCF 3.0 reader/writer + 14 OpenCDE endpoints with ETag/If-Match concurrency;
BIM Requirements rules-as-code (YAML safe_load + LOD 300/400/COBie packs); Federation Type Tree + federated viewer;
fully editable Permissions Matrix with lockout protection + audit logging; AI Estimate glass redesign with
abortable streaming + localStorage history + example prompts; module-presence dimming in sidebar (concurrent
asyncio.gather probes); sidebar deep restructure (Estimating + Catalogues split, lifecycle-ordered groups);
About Changelog 2-column layout with full v1.x-v3.x historical fill.

Fixed: clash_ai_triage replay IDOR on NULL clash_id, bim_requirements /template/ permission gate,
clash_cost_impact 404/403 timing oracle, BCF upload cap mismatch (clash 25 MiB vs bcf 100 MiB),
NOTICE.frontend.json regen for v4.1.0+, single-head alembic chain through v41_coordination_thresholds.

AGPL compliance maintained: no IfcOpenShell / OpenCascade / GPL-2-only deps.

chore(deps): minor-patch group (3 updates) (#165)

@types/three 0.183.1 -> 0.184.1 (patch — types only)
zustand 5.0.13 -> 5.0.14 (patch)
@typescript-eslint/eslint-plugin 8.59.4 -> 8.60.0 (minor)

Cherry-pick of #165 (dependabot). All three are safe — npm install
clean, no peer-dep warnings, no breaking API surface.

fix(api): nine more literal routes were shadowed by dynamic path params

Same pattern as f5a12cd46, e856e3aaa, 5950af664: a dynamic /{param}
registered before a literal route at the same depth swallows the literal
as a parameter value. The fix in every case is to move the literal route
above the dynamic one.

assemblies: /templates/ shadowed by /{assembly_id}
bim_hub: /coverage-summary/ and /federations/ shadowed by /{model_id}
dashboards: /snapshots/timeline and /snapshots/diff shadowed by /snapshots/{snapshot_id}
dwg_takeoff: compare/create-variation shadowed by compare/{other_version_id}
requirements: /by-bim-element/ shadowed by /{set_id}
rfq_bidding: /bids/ shadowed by /{rfq_id}
smart_views: /presets shadowed by /{view_id}

